      "writtenOn": "2024-06-10T20:09:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My hypothesis was that the caches, which are symlinked to /b/s/w/ir, were causing the problem, but removing the cache didn\u0027t fix it.  I believe isolated/CAS inputs and CIPD packages are also symlinked, but that doesn\u0027t appear to be the problem here.\n\nAt some point we need to stop having normal CI tasks commit code, so I\u0027ll need to either port this whole process to Louhi, or stop this process after CIPD package generation and use a roller, etc.  Maybe it\u0027s not worth the effort to get it working in this context.",
